  "translation": "Futhi lokhu okubonile inkosi: umgadi nongcwele ehlehla ezulwini ethi: “Gedani umuthi nimshube; kepha isiqu sezimpande zako siyekwe emhlabeni, siboshwe ngokushibha kwezinsimbi zentshe nobhedu, sitshalwe kutshani lwasezweni; futhi nangcedwe lezulu uthonyelwe, nasezilwaneni zaselwandle ezindala uthathe ingxenye yakhe, kuze kudlule izikhathi eziyisikhombisa phezu kwakhe.”",
